>> title: Winter Leek and Potato Gratin
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, vegetarian, bake
>> time: 1 hour

Heat the #oven{} to 190C and butter a #gratin dish{} with @butter{20%g}.

Slice @leek{3} and sweat them in @butter{30%g} in a #pan{} for ~{10%minutes} until silky.

Slice @potato{900%g} thinly and layer with the leeks, @cream{300%ml}, @milk{200%ml}, @garlic{2%cloves}, @nutmeg{1%pinch}, @salt{1%tsp} and @cheese{120%g}.

Bake for ~{45%minutes} until golden and tender.
